OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners launch court action
OL,4,Aagainst 544-bed hostel in Edinburgh
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners in Edinburgh have launched
OL,7,Fa court challenge against a decision to
OL,8,Fapprove a 544-bed hostel in the city's
OL,9,FAtholl Crescent.
OL,11,FPlans to transform four Category
OL,12,FA-listed Georgian townhouses into
OL,13,Fpod-style hostel accommodation were
OL,14,Fdetermined on appeal by a Scottish
OL,15,Fgovernment planning reporter in July.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,427,420,260,160,0,100
