OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners launch court action
OL,4,Aagainst 544-bed hostel in Edinburgh
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpponents argued serious errors were
OL,7,Fmade during the application process and
OL,8,Fraised concerns the decision could set
OL,9,Fa precedent for property companies
OL,10,Fwanting to bring large-scale tourist
OL,11,Fdevelopments to the city's heritage
OL,12,Fsites.
OL,14,FThe statutory appeal has asked the
OL,15,FCourt of Session to reverse the
OL,16,FScottish government's decision.
